  "description": "An Escher-esque maze whose cells now shift several times a second, with masonry coursing carved into every wall and chronal iridescence staining the stone. Temporal rifts fire at a treble-driven rate and glow through a psychedelic spectrum, leaving decaying echoes. The spring-smoothed cursor orbits the labyrinth, holding dilates time and pulls the camera in, and clicks send chronal shockwaves through the geometry.",
